    "detailed_description": "You've found &quot;100 Pumpkins,&quot; now find 100 more! The second in the 100 Pumpkins series.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>More pumpkins! More challenge! More puzzles! More bosses! More pitchforks! ...Did I mention more pumpkins?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In an interconnected world, you'll have to find exactly 1 pumpkin per screen to finish the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Key features:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Compact layout<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Minimap and full map showing location and completion<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Checkpoints on each screen<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Return pumpkins home for item rewards like double jump<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>New pitchfork platform mechanic<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Endings based on number of lives lost/time completed<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Upgraded bosses<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Now with music!<br><br>Requests from previous games realized:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Remap controls option, warping, retry faster after falling, more dynamic layouts",
    "about_the_game": "You've found &quot;100 Pumpkins,&quot; now find 100 more! The second in the 100 Pumpkins series.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/fd94d42fd2dc0f724e899a5c8b91ad2f.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>More pumpkins! More challenge! More puzzles! More bosses! More pitchforks! ...Did I mention more pumpkins?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/0f37e523a96c488073853ca527cf9477.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In an interconnected world, you'll have to find exactly 1 pumpkin per screen to finish the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.poster.avif?t=1753466863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.webm?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/56fd509022889b745c155e7581e571c8.mp4?t=1753466863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Key features:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Compact layout<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Minimap and full map showing location and completion<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Checkpoints on each screen<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Return pumpkins home for item rewards like double jump<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>New pitchfork platform mechanic<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Endings based on number of lives lost/time completed<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Upgraded bosses<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Now with music!<br><br>Requests from previous games realized:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824290/extras/96d4e2ce16a0ab04a3154022a4204808.webp?t=1753466863\" /></div>Remap controls option, warping, retry faster after falling, more dynamic layouts",
